# Privacy Policy for Maintain

**Last updated: 4 June 2026**

Maintain ("the app", "we", "us", "our") is a home‑maintenance tracking app developed by
Kyle Struthers. This Privacy Policy explains what information the app handles and how. We've
designed Maintain to keep your data private — **you do not need to create an account to use it.**

## Information we handle

**Data you create, stored on your device.**
Your tasks, home name, household members, reminder preferences, theme choice, and completion
history are stored locally on your device using the device's own storage. This information stays
on your device and is **not** transmitted to us or stored on our servers.

**Subscription information.**
If you purchase Maintain Premium, the purchase is processed by Apple and by our subscription
provider, RevenueCat, Inc. To verify your subscription and unlock Premium features, RevenueCat
processes a randomly‑generated app user identifier, your purchase and transaction history, and
basic device information (such as device model, operating‑system version, and country). We use
this only to determine whether your subscription is active. RevenueCat's privacy policy is
available at https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy. Your payment itself is handled by Apple under
Apple's privacy policy.

**Notifications.**
Maintain can remind you about due tasks. These are *local* notifications scheduled and delivered
on your device. We do not collect a push token and we do not send your data to a server to
deliver them.

## What we do NOT do

- We do not require an account, and we do not collect your email address. Any name you enter
  stays on your device.
- We do not include third‑party advertising.
- We do not sell or rent your information to anyone.
- We do not track you across other companies' apps or websites.

## How your information is used

We use the limited information described above solely to:

- Provide the app's core features (tracking and reminding you about home maintenance), and
- Verify your Premium subscription status.

## Data retention and deletion

Because your maintenance data is stored on your device, you remain in control of it. You can
delete all app data at any time from **Settings → Reset All Data**, or by deleting the app from
your device. Subscription records held by Apple and RevenueCat are retained according to their
respective policies; you can manage or cancel your subscription at any time in your device's
App Store settings.

## Children's privacy

Maintain is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal
information from children.

## Changes to this policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any material changes will be reflected by
updating the "Last updated" date at the top of this page.

